      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，“Grand Masters”的激战\n在观众心中留下深刻印象后，就此落幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bbf36903f16f39bf5f29d4131ac70919234c332a39dc617824e8b3cffc255a6",
